{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "0CLY", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-valutive-criterion-properness}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:48881ffa7cdae0a31dad51bc5454c3bcdcbdc2e9fd40487f1f19a4869397538f", "source_text": "Valuative criterion for properness", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bac2706721e25489deedce1906be2d89a7085df31163b603e19c5b0e90e9d095", "unit_id": "tag:0CLY:title"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0CLY", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b6baa387be35c941d473541065ecfdc14f830dcfb74f0bb2e423a6a3245896a6", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nHere is the statement.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:57c03e6320982a0a125e8ae249ddec0ae090b863391bf8272fe994b15a30d66c", "unit_id": "tag:0CLY:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CLY", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-criterion-proper}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f4b74bd44c9002222d6561aaadc5856f82b44c89e5bc1b5a7d413afc90d85fe9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c95b2ddbdf190b897aefc08ec8406acbf3ac96680267599f8695ad4738ca6e8d", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nAssume <MATH_0002> is of finite type and quasi-separated.\nThen the following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003> is proper, and\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0004> satisfies both the uniqueness and existence parts\nof the valuative criterion.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ab39ccb66ebfbcb79a2ada7e57741103deb1d18d5da5de04b65ed8b8dd7ee3da", "unit_id": "tag:0CLZ:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0CLY", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-uniqueness-and-diagonal}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-converse-uniqueness-and-diagonal}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-quasi-compact-existence-universally-closed}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-converse-existence-universally-closed}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:70a38ed055cb6317b6653b1117dedbf668f63e924f30f6c028df0f9ad951d41a", "source_text": "A proper morphism is the same thing as a separated, finite type, and\nuniversally closed morphism. Thus this lemma follows from Lemmas\n<REF_0001>,\n<REF_0002>,\n<REF_0003>, and\n<REF_0004>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e01c5952cab75333451a004ea655a0a4ec24159bfe4ab42639b2e706be81e761", "unit_id": "tag:0CLZ:proof"}
